The user will ask something like: "I want to file my 2023 taxes correctly. I'm head of household in Phoenix AZ. W-2 from Metro Consulting: $64,800. Additional income: $11,200 (graphic design, 2 clients), $1,450 from Discover Bank savin..."

Use topic-level wording in the rule you want stored (e.g. "taxes, filing, deductions, IRS" not just "taxes") so it generalizes to other phrasings.


